# Zero is even (CR 107.1, the card's reminder): with "even" chosen, Bot2's Mox Jet (mana value 0) makes Gollum riddle and Bot1 takes the +1/+1 counter (Gollum 4/2); Bot2's
# Lightning Bolt (mana value 1, odd) does not trigger it, so Bot2's life is not drained and no second mode is spent.

